		"&7Needs milk from Animal Product Automation."
	]
	"quest.26B1829FFE6A9F97.title": "Automate: Pie Crust"
	"quest.26EC6558855D5B57.quest_desc": [
		"&6TFMG&r industry starts with &aCast Iron&r: compact &airon ingots&r with &acoal&r in a Basin"
		"under a Press."
	]
	"quest.26EC6558855D5B57.title": "Cast Iron"
	"quest.26FF016B45448F85.quest_desc": [
		"Thrust from lava fuel; redstone sets the throttle."
	]
	"quest.26FF016B45448F85.title": "Rocket Engine"
	"quest.2701BFD6DE6338F6.quest_desc": [
		"A biofuel plant that keeps its own mixer superheated. Fill a &astack&r of Biofuel buckets"
		"(16)."
	]
	"quest.2701BFD6DE6338F6.title": "Automate: Biofuel"
	"quest.27196AA4E9A96C67.quest_desc": [
		"Crush magma blocks with Crushing Wheels. Make a &astack&r."
	]
	"quest.27196AA4E9A96C67.title": "Automate: Sulfur"
	"quest.27527B6B1D4EAB19.quest_desc": [
		"Use a &asteel ingot&r on &ahardened planks&r."
	]
	"quest.27527B6B1D4EAB19.title": "Steel Casing"
	"quest.276109B73191C3EB.quest_desc": [
		"Grow Dark Oak saplings and fell the trees with &aMechanical Saws&r. Leaf blocks only drop to shears:"
		"try Deployers holding shears. Make a &astack&r of each."
	]
	"quest.276109B73191C3EB.title": "Automate: Dark Oak"
	"quest.279E94C7E37D4A13.quest_desc": [
		"Production goals for the Brass Age."
	]
	"quest.279E94C7E37D4A13.title": "Brass Automation"
	"quest.27B83168473D2123.quest_desc": [
		"Clock, iron and redstone: bursts after a set time, for airbursts."
	]
	"quest.27B83168473D2123.title": "Timed Fuze"
	"quest.27BEB29B0CACBE8F.quest_desc": [
		"A magic caster. Found at Sorcerer huts."
	]
	"quest.27BEB29B0CACBE8F.title": "Sorcerer"
	"quest.27C7E3679A99E65E.quest_desc": [
		"&6Create: Smog&r: anything that burns pollutes its chunk. Pollution here is handled &aonly"
		"with Create machines&r. Stack smokestacks on a source: &a12 tall&r sends most of the smoke"
		"into the high air, where it spreads thin."
	]
	"quest.27C7E3679A99E65E.title": "Smokestack"
	"quest.27DA18D3A826CD77.quest_desc": [
		"Mine nickel ore with a Drill on a moving contraption. Make a &astack&r."
	]
	"quest.27DA18D3A826CD77.title": "Automate: Raw Nickel"
	"quest.27E0BD81A6F51F3B.quest_desc": [
		"Crush lithium ore or raw lithium. Make a &astack&r."
	]
	"quest.27E0BD81A6F51F3B.title": "Automate: Crushed Raw Lithium"
	"quest.2820B4A2B63AB6CF.quest_desc": [
		"Polish rose quartz with &aSandpaper&r (hold use), or let a Deployer holding sandpaper do it."
	]
	"quest.2820B4A2B63AB6CF.title": "Polished Rose Quartz"
	"quest.282B8F98D1E419E7.quest_desc": [
		"Gold and a lever. Iron to gold."
	]
	"quest.282B8F98D1E419E7.title": "Gold Tier"
	"quest.28ABA66692CBC7AA.quest_desc": [
		"A copper sheet and andesite alloy. Turns a valve, or anything else, a set amount."
	]
	"quest.28ABA66692CBC7AA.title": "Valve Handle"
	"quest.28B372346FDAC614.quest_desc": [
		"&aBrass Casing&r, an &aElectron Tube&r and a crafting table. Place several in a grid, connect"
		"them with the wrench, and power them to craft recipes bigger than 3x3. The &dwaystone&r"
		"recipes in this pack use them."
	]
	"quest.28B372346FDAC614.title": "Mechanical Crafter"
	"quest.28E6580DD50561CC.quest_desc": [
		"Crush lead ore, galena or raw lead. Make a &astack&r."
	]
	"quest.28E6580DD50561CC.title": "Automate: Crushed Raw Lead"
	"quest.28FA53FC0E80852A.quest_desc": [
		"A directional mine: the blast goes one way."
	]
	"quest.28FA53FC0E80852A.title": "M18A1 Claymore"
	"quest.290FA7C48BC62F5D.quest_desc": [
		"A chicken pen: breed with seeds, kill with Deployers. A Bait Trap baited with seeds works too."
		"Make a &astack&r."
	]
	"quest.290FA7C48BC62F5D.title": "Automate: Raw Chicken"
	"quest.29223CA60F2B71F1.quest_desc": [
		"A &aMesh Trap&r (zinc sheet and wool) catches small creatures and drops their loot into the"
		"container next to it. Add a lantern for a &aBait Trap&r: bait it with fish or mussels for"
		"lobsters, seeds for chickens, carrots for rabbits."
	]
	"quest.29223CA60F2B71F1.title": "Bait Trap"
	"quest.29652E2BA6AE13B3.quest_desc": [
		"A &ablaze burner&r, fluid tank, pipe and chute: a flamethrower."
	]
	"quest.29652E2BA6AE13B3.title": "Blazegun"
	"quest.297C16F5F33DB4DD.quest_desc": [
		"The simplest big cannon: &alogs&r and &agunpowder&r make a &aLog Cannon Chamber&r and an end."
		"Short range and fragile, but it fires. &cBig Cannons are multiblocks&r: check each part's Ponder."
	]
	"quest.297C16F5F33DB4DD.title": "Log Cannon"
	"quest.29984419DBB52C36.quest_desc": [
		"A &aMechanical Peeler&r peels raw cod into a steak and fish skin. Make a &astack&r."
	]
	"quest.29984419DBB52C36.title": "Automate: Cod Steak"
	"quest.29A4036FFFE0C78C.quest_desc": [
		"Crafted from a lever module: four throttle levers, one per engine."
	]
	"quest.29A4036FFFE0C78C.title": "Throttle Quadrant"
	"quest.29AF5124A7AE7006.quest_desc": [
		"A fluid pipe and an iron sheet. Opens and closes a pipe when you turn it."
	]
	"quest.29AF5124A7AE7006.title": "Fluid Valve"
	"quest.29CD29D4743899DA.quest_desc": [
		"&aMechanical Crafting&r: casing, steel, a precision mechanism and a bucket of liquid"
		"uranium."
	]
	"quest.29CD29D4743899DA.title": "Reactor Core"
	"quest.29E6A06D262FC52F.quest_desc": [
		"Iron bars and iron sheets, makes 2 (pack recipe). Holds rockets and torpedoes under"
		"aircraft; the Dual HE and APHE rockets are built on one."
	]
	"quest.29E6A06D262FC52F.title": "Rocket Bracket"
	"quest.2A178A040C410E9E.quest_desc": [
		"Crimson and warped fungus in a bowl. Make a &astack&r (16)."
	]
	"quest.2A178A040C410E9E.title": "Automate: Nether Salad"
	"quest.2A2F6D7284B0213C.quest_desc": [
		"Mechanical crafting: a Quantum Casing, a Warp Stone, andesite casing, stone bricks and"
		"dye. A one-way teleport point: it only sends you, it can't be a destination."
	]
	"quest.2A2F6D7284B0213C.title": "Portstone"
	"quest.2A475144F436F87A.quest_desc": [
		"Cooked salmon, cabbage, onion, sweet berries and a bowl. Make a &astack&r (16)."
	]
	"quest.2A475144F436F87A.title": "Automate: Grilled Salmon"
	"quest.2A5600005D446B79.quest_desc": [
		"Sand and paper on Mechanical Crafters. It doesn't stack: make &a16&r."
	]
	"quest.2A5600005D446B79.title": "Automate: Sand Paper"
	"quest.2A61066AB92169BF.quest_desc": [
		"Beetroot, tomato, a leafy green and a bowl. Make a &astack&r (16)."
	]
	"quest.2A61066AB92169BF.title": "Automate: Mixed Salad"
	"quest.2A62C8DDDC37C4AD.quest_desc": [
		"An &aEncased Fan&r blowing through water washes items on belts and depots."
	]
	"quest.2A62C8DDDC37C4AD.title": "Washing"
	"quest.2A8180943E58554F.quest_desc": [
		"The top cannon material. Cast a barrel from molten &anethersteel&r."
	]
	"quest.2A8180943E58554F.title": "Nethersteel"
	"quest.2A94ABD09E21FD9D.quest_desc": [
		"Mechanical crafting with C4 and a leather chestplate."
	]
	"quest.2A94ABD09E21FD9D.title": "Bomb Vest"
	"quest.2AA634BC04E2011F.quest_desc": [
		"Grow Oak saplings and fell the trees with &aMechanical Saws&r. Leaf blocks only drop to shears:"
		"try Deployers holding shears. Make a &astack&r of each."
	]
	"quest.2AA634BC04E2011F.title": "Automate: Oak"
	"quest.2AAC2846CE112D90.quest_desc": [
		"4 soot and string. A cheaper way to make cartridges."
	]
	"quest.2AAC2846CE112D90.title": "Filter Medium"
	"quest.2AC057F850BF58B8.quest_desc": [
		"A fluid tank and a sturdy sheet. Lets a train run on liquid fuel."
	]
	"quest.2AC057F850BF58B8.title": "Fuel Tank"
	"quest.2AEE3DA100C4AF48.quest_desc": [
		"A fluid pipe, brass sheet and electron tube: a pipe with a filter that only lets one"
		"fluid through. &eNeeds the Brass Age.&r"
	]
	"quest.2AEE3DA100C4AF48.title": "Smart Fluid Pipe"
	"quest.2B37738661240553.quest_desc": [
		"Every crop in the pack, vanilla and Farmer's Delight."
	]
	"quest.2B37738661240553.title": "Crops"
	"quest.2B4BFECA3D6F7D80.quest_desc": [
		"Do not look them in the eye."
	]
	"quest.2B4BFECA3D6F7D80.title": "Endermen"
	"quest.2B4D2F7F9C7EB7E5.quest_desc": [
		"Cows drop leather when killed. Your beef farm makes it too. Make a &astack&r."
	]
	"quest.2B4D2F7F9C7EB7E5.title": "Automate: Leather"
	"quest.2BF8DB6848A3FDAC.quest_desc": [
		"Brass sheets and andesite alloy on Mechanical Crafters. Make a &astack&r."
	]
	"quest.2BF8DB6848A3FDAC.title": "Automate: Brass Hand"
	"quest.2BFAFF067189BF14.quest_desc": [
		"Copper sheets, glass and a mechanical pump. Come up from depth without getting the"
		"bends."
	]
	"quest.2BFAFF067189BF14.title": "Decompression Chamber"
	"quest.2C489D95F51758A5.quest_desc": [
		"Shows a linked camera's view and controls linked weapons."
	]
	"quest.2C489D95F51758A5.title": "Monitor (Air War)"
	"quest.2C4D537C18CE8E78.quest_desc": [
		"Planks, slabs and a lever. A Sophisticated chest in barrel form: same tiers and upgrades."
	]
	"quest.2C4D537C18CE8E78.title": "Sophisticated Barrel"
	"quest.2C5821CD9043F72B.quest_desc": [
		"An iron block and black dye. A base where drones land and recharge."
	]
	"quest.2C5821CD9043F72B.title": "Drone Hub"
	"quest.2C59C9EE0D507C63.quest_desc": [
		"Press over a basin: 2 flint, calcite and lava compact into diorite. Make a &astack&r."
	]
	"quest.2C59C9EE0D507C63.title": "Automate: Diorite"
	"quest.2CB16ACBCC3EB9A0.quest_desc": [
		"Spout tea into glass bottles. Tea: Mixer with leaves, water and milk. Make a &astack&r (16)."
		""
		"&7Needs milk from Animal Product Automation."
	]
	"quest.2CB16ACBCC3EB9A0.title": "Automate: Builder's Tea"
	"quest.2CB3892FD558DB2F.quest_desc": [
		"Melon stems and a &aMechanical Saw&r cutting the melons. Each melon breaks into slices."
		"Make a &astack&r."
	]
	"quest.2CB3892FD558DB2F.title": "Automate: Melon Slice"
	"quest.2CCF522E002D4D92.quest_desc": [
		"&6Thick Air&r's respirator (paper, string, charcoal): helps in thin air. Not the same as"
		"Smog's respirator."
	]
	"quest.2CCF522E002D4D92.title": "Air Respirator"
	"quest.2CE27670B22613B3.quest_desc": [
		"Apply a Block of Experience to a fluid hatch. Right-click to store your own levels as"
		"liquid experience; sneak-right-click to take them back."
	]
	"quest.2CE27670B22613B3.title": "Experience Hatch"
	"quest.2CE2E4FBE8339897.quest_desc": [
		"Brass casing, redstone torch and transmitter: connects radar to other machines."
	]
	"quest.2CE2E4FBE8339897.title": "Data Link"
	"quest.2D3BE4E1574155BC.quest_desc": [
		"Rice and a bowl in the Cooking Pot. The base for many meals."
	]
	"quest.2D3BE4E1574155BC.title": "Cooked Rice"
	"quest.2D48D5DB94BF1979.quest_desc": [
		"Pulls items in and pushes them out, with filters."
	]
	"quest.2D48D5DB94BF1979.title": "Hopper Upgrade"
	"quest.2D4CB59184084B3F.quest_desc": [
		"Raw chicken through a smoking fan. Make a &astack&r."
	]
	"quest.2D4CB59184084B3F.title": "Automate: Cooked Chicken"
	"quest.2D89FEC40D52AEA2.quest_desc": [
		"Same ingredients as the funnel. Put it over a belt to &asplit, filter and balance&r items"
		"across belts."
	]
	"quest.2D89FEC40D52AEA2.title": "Brass Tunnel"
	"quest.2DA10E741DEED39B.quest_desc": [
		"Made with a gold sheet. Wear &aEngineer's Goggles&r to see stress, speed and contents"
		"when you look at machines."
	]
	"quest.2DA10E741DEED39B.title": "Engineer's Goggles"
	"quest.2DA2BD47F29DA63F.quest_desc": [
		"Cave vines hanging from a ceiling. Also: &aHaunting&r sweet berries with a fan blowing"
		"through soul fire turns them into glow berries. Make a &astack&r."
	]
	"quest.2DA2BD47F29DA63F.title": "Automate: Glow Berries"
	"quest.2DC9D22EAFD82C48.quest_desc": [
		"Smelt nitrate ore into &bnitrogen concentrate&r, then fan it through &bpowder snow&r."
		"Nitrogen coolant keeps bigger reactors from melting down."
	]
	"quest.2DC9D22EAFD82C48.title": "Coolant"
	"quest.2DD1199EE570E8A6.quest_desc": [
		"Feed andesite and iron (or zinc) nuggets into a &aMixer&r over a Basin, no heat needed."
		"Make a &astack&r."
	]
	"quest.2DD1199EE570E8A6.title": "Automate: Andesite Alloy"
	"quest.2DD644438104E15A.quest_desc": [
		"Brass casing, electron tube and redstone link: marks you as friendly."
	]
	"quest.2DD644438104E15A.title": "Identification Transponder"
	"quest.2DFC4BBEEC0277CA.quest_desc": [
		"Grow Dead saplings and fell the trees with &aMechanical Saws&r. Leaf blocks only drop to shears:"
		"try Deployers holding shears. Make a &astack&r of each."
	]
	"quest.2DFC4BBEEC0277CA.title": "Automate: Dead"
	"quest.2E3CBB0BC9E0B8B0.quest_desc": [
		"&aMechanical Crafting&r from thorium ingots."
	]
	"quest.2E3CBB0BC9E0B8B0.title": "Thorium Rod"
	"quest.2E3F189B4FBB8213.quest_desc": [
		"Smithing table: a Blaze Upgrade template, a Blaze Burner and an anvil. Repairs and"
		"combines enchanted gear with liquid experience."
	]
	"quest.2E3F189B4FBB8213.title": "Blaze Forger"
	"quest.2E52F82D051E855F.quest_desc": [
		"Paper, electron tube and redstone: choose what radar sees."
	]
	"quest.2E52F82D051E855F.title": "Detection Filter"
	"quest.2E6F6CB4B39FF8FE.quest_desc": [
		"Spyglass, brass sheet and black dye."
	]
	"quest.2E6F6CB4B39FF8FE.title": "Scope"
	"quest.2EAEFDD17395F2DB.quest_desc": [
		"Cut a porkchop on the board. Meat cuts cook faster and stack into meals."
	]
	"quest.2EAEFDD17395F2DB.title": "Raw Bacon"
	"quest.2F08F7225E5B99D0.quest_desc": [
		"Steel, a display board, an empty schematic and a precision mechanism. It shows where"
		"every reactor part goes."
	]
	"quest.2F08F7225E5B99D0.title": "Reactor Blueprint"
	"quest.2F242A05FDED1B15.quest_desc": [
		"Raw lobster through a smoking fan. Make a &astack&r."
	]
	"quest.2F242A05FDED1B15.title": "Automate: Cooked Lobster"
	"quest.2F30B476C024F7EC.quest_desc": [
		"Mill bones (or calcite) with a &aMillstone&r or Crushing Wheels. Make a &astack&r."
	]
	"quest.2F30B476C024F7EC.title": "Automate: Bone Meal"
	"quest.2F37EAD823F5C5A1.quest_desc": [
		"Brass casing, a precision mechanism and all three filters (detection, targeting,"
		"identification). Applies them to a whole radar network at once."
	]
	"quest.2F37EAD823F5C5A1.title": "Network Controller"
	"quest.2F3B184CE57794CA.quest_desc": [
		"&eChanged in this pack:&r a &aQuantum Pearl&r and an &aamethyst shard&r make 4 Warp Dust."
	]
	"quest.2F3B184CE57794CA.title": "Warp Dust"
	"quest.2F4686DB77BD1C7C.quest_desc": [
		"Base, crank and hammer, built over an oil deposit, pump &acrude oil&r."
	]
	"quest.2F4686DB77BD1C7C.title": "Pumpjack"
	"quest.2F50915EC162CD62.quest_desc": [
		"Fangs and vexes. Drops a Totem of Undying."
	]
	"quest.2F50915EC162CD62.title": "Evoker"
	"quest.2F6A610835C74427.quest_desc": [
		"Tougher and heavier than rolled steel: TFMG nickel, heavy plates and a steel block."
	]
	"quest.2F6A610835C74427.title": "Nickel Hull Armor"
	"quest.2F71F26C3C9A909B.quest_desc": [
		"Crushed lead ore through a lava fan. Make a &astack&r."
	]
	"quest.2F71F26C3C9A909B.title": "Automate: Lead Ingot"
	"quest.2F7B3CC7044ABB69.quest_desc": [
		"A Crushing Wheel, industrial iron and iron plates. A wheel that cuts through"
		"terrain as it drives."
	]
	"quest.2F7B3CC7044ABB69.title": "Rock Cutting Wheel"
	"quest.2F8A12AA39826B5F.quest_desc": [
		"Iron ingots, iron nuggets and wooden slabs: the basic cannonball."
	]
	"quest.2F8A12AA39826B5F.title": "Solid Shot"
	"quest.2FA74C71CCB3010E.quest_desc": [
		"A copper block and copper nuggets. Lets water in and out of the ballast tanks."
	]
	"quest.2FA74C71CCB3010E.title": "Ballast Vent"
	"quest.2FC01DCFD815E793.quest_desc": [
		"A &abrass sheet&r and &aandesite alloy&r. The business end of a Deployer."
	]
	"quest.2FC01DCFD815E793.title": "Brass Hand"
	"quest.2FCB6C6C6877CFF3.quest_desc": [
		"Feed cabbages under a &aSlicer&r holding a knife (it runs cutting board recipes). Make a"
		"&astack&r."
	]
	"quest.2FCB6C6C6877CFF3.title": "Automate: Cabbage Leaf"
	"quest.2FD488C9341124C7.quest_desc": [
		"Mixer: lobster, mussels, a raw fish steak, kelp and milk; a Spout fills bowls. Make a &astack&r."
		""
		"&7Needs milk from Animal Product Automation."
	]
	"quest.2FD488C9341124C7.title": "Automate: Seafood Chowder"
	"quest.2FD7E35E79AC7086.quest_desc": [
		"A Press over a basin compacts an egg, sugar and cinder flour into a cake base. Make a &astack&r."
	]
	"quest.2FD7E35E79AC7086.title": "Automate: Blaze Cake Base"
	"quest.2FEB14F8B42244B0.quest_desc": [
		"Hit their fireballs back."
	]
	"quest.2FEB14F8B42244B0.title": "Ghasts"
	"quest.2FF0E42C2B84B910.quest_desc": [
		"Mixer: 2 onions, bread, milk and a bowl. Make a &astack&r (16)."
		""
		"&7Needs milk from Animal Product Automation."
	]
	"quest.2FF0E42C2B84B910.title": "Automate: Onion Soup"
	"quest.300F6C1A33C7F1A4.quest_desc": [
		"Raw cod through a smoking fan. Make a &astack&r."
	]
	"quest.300F6C1A33C7F1A4.title": "Automate: Cooked Cod"
	"quest.302F7A79DA6CDED1.quest_desc": [
		"Cook an egg in the skillet."
	]
	"quest.302F7A79DA6CDED1.title": "Fried Egg"
	"quest.3056509D9518AA4D.quest_desc": [
		"&6Farmer's Delight&r: a &aknife&r cuts food, harvests straw from grass, and gets more"
		"drops from animals. Flint and a stick."
	]
	"quest.3056509D9518AA4D.title": "Flint Knife"
	"quest.30690D9174F34F2D.quest_desc": [
		"Quantum Paper, a gold nugget and purple dye. One use: teleports you to your spawn"
		"point."
	]
	"quest.30690D9174F34F2D.title": "Return Scroll"
	"quest.306B9A9B85549504.quest_desc": [
		"Compact dough, eggs and sugar into a cake base, bake it with a smoking fan, then Spout"
		"chocolate on. Make a &astack&r."
		""
		"&7Needs milk and eggs from Animal Product Automation."
	]
	"quest.306B9A9B85549504.title": "Automate: Chocolate Cake"
	"quest.307B7F558FE98190.quest_desc": [
		"Brass casing, a brass sheet and a precision mechanism. Plots a course and can"
		"steer the craft toward it."
	]
	"quest.307B7F558FE98190.title": "Navigation Table"
	"quest.3090AE0731E93EDF.quest_desc": [
		"Grow Jungle saplings and fell the trees with &aMechanical Saws&r. Leaf blocks only drop to shears:"
		"try Deployers holding shears. Make a &astack&r of each."
	]
	"quest.3090AE0731E93EDF.title": "Automate: Jungle"
	"quest.3097A9281C1F2831.quest_desc": [
		"Mill sugar cane with a &aMillstone&r or Crushing Wheels. Make a &astack&r."
	]
	"quest.3097A9281C1F2831.title": "Automate: Sugar"
	"quest.309E4737F755212E.quest_desc": [
		"Mixer: dough, cabbage, onion, and raw chicken, pork or beef (or a brown mushroom)."
		"Make a &astack&r."
	]
	"quest.309E4737F755212E.title": "Automate: Dumplings"
	"quest.30B182214955D9F9.quest_desc": [
		"Brass casing, a chute and a copper spool. Charges batteries on a moving contraption."
	]
	"quest.30B182214955D9F9.title": "Portable Energy Interface"
	"quest.311209C8852B8B2E.quest_desc": [
		"Comes off every fish the Mechanical Peeler peels. Make a &astack&r."
	]
	"quest.311209C8852B8B2E.title": "Automate: Fish Skin"
	"quest.315E6012D36080BC.quest_desc": [
		"Brass casing, a compass and a gyroscopic mechanism. Outputs redstone by tilt: the"
		"sensor behind auto-leveling."
	]
	"quest.315E6012D36080BC.title": "Gimbal Sensor"
	"quest.316983E7A8C8D912.quest_desc": [
		"Sequenced assembly: press an &aAutocannon Cartridge Sheet&r into a case. Fill it with powder"
		"and add a round to make ammunition."
	]
	"quest.316983E7A8C8D912.title": "Autocannon Cartridge"
	"quest.3181DF6D189E6B9B.quest_desc": [
		"Grow Mangrove propagules and fell the trees with &aMechanical Saws&r. Leaf blocks only drop to shears:"
		"try Deployers holding shears. Make a &astack&r of each."
	]
	"quest.3181DF6D189E6B9B.title": "Automate: Mangrove"
	"quest.3187C8EA3A115C8A.quest_desc": [
		"&6Tier 2 and 3:&r seed oil and biomass into &6biofuel&r, then biofuel into &cnapalm&r. Both need a"
		"&6superheated&r burner to brew."
	]
	"quest.3187C8EA3A115C8A.title": "Liquid Fuels"
	"quest.3188AB5143C724A6.quest_desc": [
		"Brass needs &6heat&r, and heat comes from a &aBlaze Burner&r. Craft an"
		"&aEmpty Blaze Burner&r from &airon sheets&r and &anetherrack&r."
	]
	"quest.3188AB5143C724A6.title": "Empty Blaze Burner"
	"quest.31C45B812830C2D5.quest_desc": [
		"&6Illager Invasion&r: a whole new illager army. They join raids, and guard new structures:"
		"&cIllager Forts&r, &cLabyrinths&r, &cIllusioner Towers&r, and Firecaller and Sorcerer huts."
		"Start with the &aProvoker&r."
	]
	"quest.31C45B812830C2D5.title": "Illager Invasion"
	"quest.31C9C301A68F80A3.quest_desc": [
		"Axes. Shield up."
	]
	"quest.31C9C301A68F80A3.title": "Vindicators"
	"quest.31DD8F44F818C802.quest_desc": [
		"2 wheat and sweet berries (Mechanical Crafters). Make a &astack&r."
	]
	"quest.31DD8F44F818C802.title": "Automate: Sweet Berry Cookie"
	"quest.31E5AAE05E104B0F.quest_desc": [
		"Grow Acacia saplings and fell the trees with &aMechanical Saws&r. Leaf blocks only drop to shears:"
		"try Deployers holding shears. Make a &astack&r of each."
	]
	"quest.31E5AAE05E104B0F.title": "Automate: Acacia"
	"quest.324B5B374FEE171F.quest_desc": [
		"A spyglass, comparator, ender pearl, glowstone, glass and planks. Opens your network"
		"from anywhere nearby."
	]
	"quest.324B5B374FEE171F.title": "Wireless Terminal"
	"quest.324CA84D44AF248A.quest_desc": [
		"&6Tier 1:&r blaze cakes, and the blaze rods, powder and lava behind them."
	]
	"quest.324CA84D44AF248A.title": "Blaze Fuel"
	"quest.329AE9F04A03675F.quest_desc": [
		"A sheep pen: breed with wheat, kill with Deployers. Make a &astack&r."
	]
	"quest.329AE9F04A03675F.title": "Automate: Raw Mutton"
	"quest.32D51BA220BED16C.quest_desc": [
		"Every quest under &aDiamonds&r is done: 3 production lines running on their own."
	]
	"quest.32D51BA220BED16C.title": "Diamonds Mastered"
	"quest.32E1A88C05AE09BB.quest_desc": [
		"Every ore in the pack, from raw rock to netherite, on autopilot."
	]
	"quest.32E1A88C05AE09BB.title": "Ore Automation Mastered"
	"quest.32E70B970B951381.quest_desc": [
		"&cElytras are disabled.&r End ships no longer carry one, and gliding is blocked even if"
		"you find one."
		""
		"If you want to fly, build an aircraft with &6Create Aeronautics&r."
	]
	"quest.32E70B970B951381.title": "No Elytras"
	"quest.3371D99BDCDED5AC.quest_desc": [
		"Use a &abrass ingot&r on a &astripped log&r (or stripped wood). The casing for Create's"
		"advanced machines."
	]
	"quest.3371D99BDCDED5AC.title": "Brass Casing"
	"quest.337BDF1C0EDED954.quest_desc": [
		"Red sand and paper on Mechanical Crafters. It doesn't stack: make &a16&r."
	]
	"quest.337BDF1C0EDED954.title": "Automate: Red Sand Paper"
	"quest.3397EF3620FAACEE.quest_desc": [
		"Cod steaks through a smoking fan. Make a &astack&r."
	]
	"quest.3397EF3620FAACEE.title": "Automate: Cooked Cod Steak"
	"quest.342B99D81C59AC9B.quest_desc": [
		"Mixer: pasta, raw mutton, tomato sauce and a bowl. Make a &astack&r (16)."
	]
	"quest.342B99D81C59AC9B.title": "Automate: Pasta with Mutton Chop"
	"quest.342DFAF2E6167184.quest_desc": [
		"Mixer: pumpkin slice, raw pork, a leafy green, milk and a bowl. Make a &astack&r (16)."
		""
		"&7Needs milk from Animal Product Automation."
	]
	"quest.342DFAF2E6167184.title": "Automate: Pumpkin Soup"
	"quest.3473E7F36010A291.quest_desc": [
		"Feasts are placed blocks that serve several plates. One feeds a whole squad before a raid."
	]
	"quest.3473E7F36010A291.title": "Roast Chicken Feast"
	"quest.349E01B3EFC69CE7.quest_desc": [
		"Bait Traps catch them. Cook them with a smoking fan, or mix them with kelp and milk into"
		"&aLobster Soup&r."
	]
	"quest.349E01B3EFC69CE7.title": "Lobster"
	"quest.34C95B3009441921.quest_desc": [
		"Apply steel to a brass casing."
	]
	"quest.34C95B3009441921.title": "Reactor Casing"
	"quest.34D8A081AEFAEBB4.quest_desc": [
		"&cBoss:&r the &6Storm Breaker&r, a high-altitude battle airship with escorts. Radar to find"
		"it, guns to bring it down, oxygen to chase it up high."
		"&aClick the checkmark when you're ready&r (quest edit mode OFF): the attack starts on the spot. Fight near your base."
	]
	"quest.34D8A081AEFAEBB4.title": "Wave 8: The Storm Breaker"
	"quest.34DFD0F2822B27B8.quest_desc": [
		"Every quest under &aBakery&r is done: 15 production lines running on their own."
	]
	"quest.34DFD0F2822B27B8.title": "Bakery Mastered"
	"quest.34E9EC54D3ED4DE2.quest_desc": [
		"&eThis pack's own recipe:&r compact &a9 Blocks of Coal&r in a Basin over a &6Superheated&r"
		"burner to make &b1 Diamond&r. Automate it and make a &astack&r (576 coal blocks)."
	]
	"quest.34E9EC54D3ED4DE2.title": "Automate: Diamonds"
	"quest.3516F58AAEBDAF62.quest_desc": [
		"Netherite upgrade: holds far more air."
	]
	"quest.3516F58AAEBDAF62.title": "Reinforced Air Bladder"
	"quest.3527520056C4B53A.quest_desc": [
		"A belt and a shaft (makes 4). Heavier vehicles."
	]
	"quest.3527520056C4B53A.title": "Large Tire"
	"quest.3575C6B29A7007D0.quest_desc": [
		"An illager &6armored car&r with a drill, built from real Create parts, rolls in. Stop the"
		"crew. Cannons help."
		"&aClick the checkmark when you're ready&r (quest edit mode OFF): the attack starts on the spot. Fight near your base."
	]
	"quest.3575C6B29A7007D0.title": "Wave 5: Armored Drill Car"
	"quest.3578897E87BC07AF.quest_desc": [
		"A spellcaster scholar of the illagers."
	]
	"quest.3578897E87BC07AF.title": "Archivist"
	"quest.3583295B288EBDC6.quest_desc": [
		"Crushed end stone: part of the levitite process (see JEI)."
	]
	"quest.3583295B288EBDC6.title": "End Stone Powder"
	"quest.359CB1C16A2C769F.quest_desc": [
		"Sequenced assembly on a &asturdy sheet&r with a &adiamond&r and a &aRedstone Pearl&r."
	]
	"quest.359CB1C16A2C769F.title": "Advanced Component"
	"quest.35A573EF28FA0DF3.quest_desc": [
		"Harvester rows, same as wheat. Make a &astack&r."
	]
	"quest.35A573EF28FA0DF3.title": "Automate: Potato"
	"quest.35B0C13C9224365A.quest_desc": [
		"Crush gravel with Crushing Wheels. Make a &astack&r."
	]
	"quest.35B0C13C9224365A.title": "Automate: Sand"
	"quest.361D29A4C61B6861.quest_desc": [
		"Quantum casing, Quantum Mechanism, Redstone Pearl and a transmitter. Links portals."
	]
	"quest.361D29A4C61B6861.title": "Advanced TP Link"
	"quest.363A6F521A378478.quest_desc": [
		"Copper sheets and a barrel. Tanks join into bigger tanks when placed next to each other."
		"A tall tank is also the body of a &6steam boiler&r."
	]
	"quest.363A6F521A378478.title": "Fluid Tank"
	"quest.363DDA5259789DDD.quest_desc": [
		"&6Improved Mobs&r: mobs get stronger the longer you play. The &dDifficulty&r number"
		"(bottom right) goes up over time. Higher difficulty means better gear, more health, and"
		"mobs that break blocks to reach you."
	]
	"quest.363DDA5259789DDD.title": "First Blood"
	"quest.364421849A7C3642.quest_desc": [
		"Pie crust, apples, sugar and wheat (Mechanical Crafters). Make a &astack&r."
		""
		"&7Needs milk from Animal Product Automation."
	]
	"quest.364421849A7C3642.title": "Automate: Apple Pie"
	"quest.367A3FC09B9D2759.quest_desc": [
		"Compact 6 soot."
	]
	"quest.367A3FC09B9D2759.title": "Graphite"
	"quest.367C2F2B0C2B6767.quest_desc": [
		"Mechanical crafting: Warp Dust, andesite casing, stone bricks and flint (makes 2)."
		"Step on one to warp to the plate it is linked to."
	]
	"quest.367C2F2B0C2B6767.title": "Warp Plate"
	"quest.36A98B3D0D68A88B.quest_desc": [
		"Mushrooms on &arich soil&r grow into colonies. A &aSlicer&r with a knife cuts a colony into"
		"mushrooms. Make a &astack&r."
	]
	"quest.36A98B3D0D68A88B.title": "Automate: Brown Mushroom"
	"quest.36AAE0F95A2E1194.quest_desc": [
		"&6Rolled Homogeneous Armor&r: armor plating in many camo colors. Protects against cannon"
		"fire. Cut an &airon block&r in a &astonecutter&r (any color, also layered, riveted and"
		"slashed styles)."
	]
	"quest.36AAE0F95A2E1194.title": "Hardened Steel Armor"
	"quest.36B574ACD5B8C2FA.quest_desc": [
		"Aircraft armor that takes more hits: Air War titanium sheets around an aluminum sheet."
	]
	"quest.36B574ACD5B8C2FA.title": "Titanium Hull Armor"
	"quest.36E772B547DD464B.quest_desc": [
		"Pulls nearby items in. Great for clearing loot after a fight."
	]
	"quest.36E772B547DD464B.title": "Magnet Upgrade"
	"quest.37517A958378F385.quest_desc": [
		"Mixer: a bone, a bowl, and glow berries, a mushroom, hanging roots or glow lichen."
		"Make a &astack&r (16)."
